    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Well, for my pressure, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I'm on sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines. Dolo, 650 milligrams, when I get the fever. I used to take ramipril, but I stopped it.",
